  "description": "L2-style login coordinator for SetNet: a dedicated login node authenticates the account, returns the game-server list, and issues a one-time session token the client uses to enter the chosen game server (which validates it against a shared token store). server.UseLoginServer(...) + client.UseLogin(). Composition over SetNet.Accounts (auth delegate) / SetNet.LoadBalancer (server list). Depends only on SetNet.",
